l=%2FEngine.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2FEngine.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2FEngine.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2FEngine.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2FEngine.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2FEngine.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2FEngine.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><div style="position:absolute;z-index:1;right:-100px;top:20px;width:200px;height:220px;background:linear-gradient(to bottom right, #F2F4F7, #CFD8E2);transform:rotate(30deg)"></div></div></a></div></div></div></section><section class="py-6 md:py-9 lg:py-12 bg-[#EFF9FF] md:bg-white flex justify-center"><div class="relative w-full px-[16px] sm:px-[24px] md:px-0 md:max-w-md lg:max-w-lg xl:max-w-xl 2xl:max-w-2xl"><div class="bg-[#EFF9FF] p-2 md:p-5 md:p-[24px] lg:p-[56px] rounded-[32px]"><div class="md:text-center mb-[16px] md:mb-[40px] lg:mb-[56px]"><h2 class="font-bold text-neutral-900 text-xl md:text-2xl lg:text-5xl mb-[4px] md:mb-2 lg:mb-[12px]">Do you own a repair shop?</h2><p class="font-normal text-base md:text-l lg:text-xl text-neutral-800">Discover how Steer &amp; AutoOps help auto shops book more appointments, connect with customers, and deliver exceptional service.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-[24px] lg:gap-[32px] xl:gap-[56px]"><div class="p-[16px] md:p-[24px] lg:p-[40px] bg-white rounded-[24px] flex flex-col"><div class="relative mb-4 h-[24px] w-[83.57px] md:h-[32px] md:w-[111.4px] lg:h-[40px] lg:w-[139.3px]"><img alt="Steer Logo" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2FSteerLogo.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2FSteerLogo.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2FSteerLogo.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2FSteerLogo.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2FSteerLogo.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2FSteerLogo.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2FSteerLogo.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2FSteerLogo.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2FSteerLogo.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><h3 class="font-bold md:text-2xl lg:text-4xl mb-[4px] text-neutral-900">Best-in-Class Marketing and Communications Platform</h3><p class="font-bold md:text-lg lg:text-2xl bg-grey-gradient mb-[4px] md:mb-[16px]"></p><p class="font-normal md:text-base lg:text-lg text-gray-600 lg:min-h-[48px]">Get more customers. Keep them coming back. All with one powerful CRM.</p><a class="font-semibold text-lg text-center w-full bg-primary-blue text-white px-6 py-[12px] rounded-[8px] hover:bg-blue-700 transition my-[16px] md:my-[24px]" href="https://steercrm.com">Get Started</a><div><h4 class="font-semibold text-lg text-neutral-900 mb-[12px]">Features:</h4><ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-[16px] gap-y-[12px]"><li class="md:text-sm lg:text-base font-medium text-neutral-900 flex items-center gap-2"><div><svg width="18" height="18" class="h-5 w-5 text-blue-600" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M9 0.875C4.51992 0.875 0.875 4.51992 0.875 9C0.875 13.4801 4.51992 17.125 9 17.125C13.4801 17.125 17.125 13.4801 17.125 9C17.125 4.51992 13.4801 0.875 9 0.875ZM13.2285 6.27695L7.97852 12.527C7.92093 12.5955 7.84927 12.651 7.76839 12.6894C7.68752 12.7279 7.59932 12.7486 7.50977 12.75H7.49922C7.41162 12.75 7.325 12.7315 7.24499 12.6959C7.16497 12.6602 7.09335 12.6081 7.03477 12.543L4.78477 10.043C4.72762 9.98236 4.68317 9.91094 4.65403 9.83291C4.62488 9.75488 4.61163 9.67181 4.61504 9.58859C4.61846 9.50536 4.63848 9.42365 4.67392 9.34827C4.70936 9.27289 4.75952 9.20536 4.82143 9.14964C4.88335 9.09392 4.95578 9.05114 5.03447 9.02381C5.11315 8.99648 5.19651 8.98516 5.27963 8.99051C5.36276 8.99585 5.44398 9.01776 5.51851 9.05495C5.59305 9.09213 5.6594 9.14384 5.71367